WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 056. A LIST OF ASSETS IS NOT A MOAT.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
MAP EACH ASSET TO RIGHTS, PERMISSIONS, DEPENDENCIES, SUBSTITUTES, AND EVIDENCE.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
POSSESSION, ACCESS, PERMISSION, CONTROL, AND OWNERSHIP ARE DIFFERENT CLAIMS.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
REMOVE ONE SUPPOSED MOAT. RECOMPUTE FRAGILITY, SUBSTITUTES, AND UNSUPPORTED DEPENDENCIES.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A MAP CANNOT DETERMINE OWNERSHIP, VALUE, DEFENSIBILITY, OR COMMERCIAL SUCCESS.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
TEST WHAT SURVIVES REMOVAL. MAKE RIGHTS AND FAILURE PATHS LEGIBLE.
